### T1. No token: 401
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts

### T2. Wrong password: 401
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "viewer@learnapp.local", "password": "wrong" }

### T3a. Log in as Viewer: 200 (copy accessToken into @viewerToken)
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "viewer@learnapp.local", "password": "Viewer123!" }

### T3b. Log in as CaseManager: 200 (copy into @caseToken)
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "case@learnapp.local", "password": "Case123!" }

### T3c. Log in as Admin: 200 (copy into @adminToken)
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@learnapp.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### T4. Viewer reads: 200
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### T5. Who am I: 200 with name, email, and roles ["Viewer"]
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### T6. Viewer creates: 403
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Lovelace", "email": "ada.lovelace@example.com" }

### T7. CaseManager creates: 201 (rerunning gives 409; change the email)
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{caseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Lovelace", "email": "ada.lovelace@example.com" }

### T8. CaseManager deletes: 403
DELETE {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{caseToken}}

### T9. Admin deletes the contact from T7: 204 (use the id from T7's response)
DELETE {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/7
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### T10. Tampered token: 401 (paste a real token, then change ONE character in its middle part)
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer paste-a-token-and-change-one-character

### T11. Still anonymous: 200
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

###
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/di-demo